@wuxibin89, as per your comments and suggestion, I have moved trailing-padding trimming for `log_probs` and preparation of a padded `TensorDict` for PPO into [verl-hardware-plugin PR #47](https://github.com/verl-project/verl-hardware-plugin/pull/47).

